That branch now also carries three core fixes found by riscv-dv (63a50a5 viota.m vs2 / .vf NaN-box, 3ae351d PMP
8-byte accesses), not on main; 3ae351d also conflicts with the FPGA_TIMING parallel PMP. Trees, each a detached
worktree with a diff applied (not committed):
  main      = f2393973 with the RTL of 63a50a5 and 3ae351d reverse-applied. Its rtl/ differs from origin/main
              9da0006 only by the sim-only commit trace (`ifndef SYNTHESIS / SIGIL_COMMIT_TRACE).
  main+vfix = f2393973 with only 3ae351d's RTL reverse-applied (keeps the viota/NaN-box fix, which is outside
              #53's code), so sigil_vector_test runs to the end on both sides.
  branch, branch+vfix = 871b2dd + `git diff 9da0006 <main tree>` (git apply -3; the only conflict, the
              sim/Makefile TESTS list, keeps both lists). core_tb with SIGIL_FPGA_TIMING + SIGIL_VRF_OREG.
