The 110 generated programs are identical on all sides (asm md5); status and first divergence are identical
for every (test, seed). So no mismatch is new on the branch: nothing for #53. The mismatches, all on main too
(verification track; fixed on 8-riscv-dv, not yet on main):
  sigil_vector_test seeds 1-4: viota.m v24, v5, v0.t (record #3344/#3344/#6738/#3346): the core traps illegal
